    "description": {
      "value": "A crystalline sphere, swirling with constantly shifting constellations, sits atop a lyrakien staff, a silver shaft that sparkles with the gentle glow of starlight. Desnans first created the staves, inspired by the music- and freedom-loving lyrakien azatas, but these staves are popular with spellcasters of all faiths who like travel, art, or the stars. While wielding a lyrakien staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on saving throws against incapacitation effects.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\nThe circumstance bonus is +2.\n\n- - **3rd:** dream message, safe passage, wanderer's guide\n- - **4th:** concordant choir, dream message, freedom of movement, remove paralysis"
